WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.812
A useful counseling record keeps the conversation, the

00:00:03.812 --> 00:00:07.274
next steps, and the acknowledgement clear to both

00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:07.707
people.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.274
From the authorized member view, record the counseling.

00:00:11.274 --> 00:00:14.441
Check the Marine, the date, and the type

00:00:14.441 --> 00:00:16.024
before adding the summary.

00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:19.756
Write specific strengths and improvements, then agree on

00:00:19.756 --> 00:00:23.088
a measurable next step and follow-up date. Review

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:25.171
the record before saving it.

00:00:25.571 --> 00:00:28.881
The Marine opens the counseling and reviews the

00:00:28.881 --> 00:00:32.192
content. Both views should refer to the same

00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:33.847
conversation and next steps.

00:00:34.247 --> 00:00:37.688
Acknowledge after reviewing the record. Confirm the status

00:00:37.688 --> 00:00:41.129
changed, and check how the acknowledged record can

00:00:41.129 --> 00:00:43.279
be handled in this deployment.

00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:47.126
Keep the follow-up visible so the conversation leads

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:47.988
to action.
